{{Classic Era}}
Cryosilk Armor is special planar armor usable only by INT casters. In Everquest Legends, it is confirmed to drop from [[a haunted chest]] in [[Plane of Hate]] - but only from the two chests that spawn during the Innoruuk raid instance. Also confirmed that at least the Belt drops from [[a spinechiller spider]] in [[Plane of Fear]]. Potentially all of them drop from the spiders.


